<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Sales of 18,700 MT were mainly for Angola (5,200 MT), China (4,500 MT), Hong Kong (4,000 MT), and the Congo (3,500 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 35,100 MT--the largest since the marketing-year began--were primarily to China (28,000 MT).</p>
